  "description": "Isle Vacation is a relaxed walking simulator set on a sun-warmed island full of hidden corners, quiet beaches, and locals who always seem to know a shortcut. Your only goal is to explore — wander cobbled paths, follow the smell of salt air to the shore, and uncover the island's scattered landmarks at your own pace.\n\nFeatures:\n>A handcrafted isle to roam freely, with no timers, fail states, or wrong answers\n>Dozens of locations to discover — from sleepy fishing docks and clifftop viewpoints\n>Short play sessions or long afternoon drifts — Isle Vacation fits however much time you have\n\nWhether you're after a ten-minute breather or a few hours of aimless wandering, the isle is always there, waiting.",
